    SD1_D3:'SD1_D3',PWR_GPIO0:'WL_REG_ON',PWR_WAKEUP0:'WL_HOST_WAKE'},
   'SD1 is on the right package edge — which is why the module sits right of the SoC on the board.',1),
  R('R18','22R',600,230,'H','SD1_CLK','SD1_CLK_W','Series damping at the SoC end.'),
  R('R19','10k',620,400,'V','SD1_CMD','VDD3V3','Command pull-up.'),
